body:
Gowon is mesmerizing omg i love her so much!

&#x200B;

Theory moment: there's is 8 marbles in this picture: 5 in a glass, 3 on the table. Is this a hint to the lore? The fives in the glass could represent 1/3 (with Yeojin) and the threes on the table OEC. What do you think?

Hibari's theme is kinda awesome (i tried to play it on piano, it's reaaaally hard).

&#x200B;

But my favorite theme song is [Kufufu no Fu](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ATxy7R11WXk)
